ll animate-ping\" data-kid=\"55\"></span></div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"56\">COORD_Y: 74.0060</div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"57\">ALTITUDE: 4,204.88m</div>\n                            <div class=\"pt-4 opacity-30\" data-kid=\"58\">ENCRYPT: SHARD_7F</div>\n                        </div>\n                        \n                        <div class=\"absolute -inset-10 border border-cyan-500/10 rounded-full rotate-ui pointer-events-none\" data-kid=\"59\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -inset-14 border border-cyan-500/5 rounded-full rotate-ui pointer-events-none\" style=\"animation-direction: reverse;\" data-kid=\"60\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 w-48 h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-transparent\" data-kid=\"61\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            \n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"62\">\n                <div class=\"text-[8px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase opacity-50\" data-kid=\"63\">INITIALIZING_SCROLL</div>\n                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-500 to-transparent\" data-kid=\"64\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        \n        <section id=\"experience\" class=\"py-32 px-12 bg-black/40 border-y border-white/5\" data-kid=\"65\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-16\" data-kid=\"66\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"67\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold font-['Space_Grotesk'] italic text-white flex items-center\" data-kid=\"68\">\n                        <span class=\"text-cyan-500 text-6xl mr-4\" data-kid=\"69\">/</span> PROCESSING_LOGS\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"h-[2px] flex-grow bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500/40 via-cyan-500/10 to-transparent\" data-kid=\"70\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"border border-cyan-500/20 bg-[#151822]/60 rounded-sm overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\" data-kid=\"71\">\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[160px_280px_1fr] bg-cyan-500/10 p-5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase border-b border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400\" data-kid=\"72\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"73\">[ TIMESTAMP ]</div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"74\">[ PROCESS_NAME ]</div>\n                        <div data-kid=\"75\">[ SYSTEM_OUTPUT / DIAGNOSTICS ]</div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"divide-y divide-cyan-500/10 font-['JetBrains_Mono']\" data-kid=\"76\">\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[160px_280px_1fr] p-6 hover:bg-cyan-500/5 transition-all group cursor-default\" data-kid=\"77\">\n                            <div class=\"text-cyan-500/60 text-sm\" data-kid=\"78\">2023.08.12</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-orange-500 font-bold tracking-wider text-sm\" data-kid=\"79\">LEAD_ARCHITECT</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-gray-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors leading-relaxed text-sm\" data-kid=\"80\">\n                                Deployed trans-continental neural routing kernel. Minimized freight latency across 14 global nodes by 42%. Handled overflow orchestration via AWS Lambda shards.\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[160px_280px_1fr] p-6 bg-black/20 hover:bg-cyan-500/5 transition-all group cursor-default\" data-kid=\"81\">\n                            <div class=\"text-cyan-500/60 text-sm\" data-kid=\"82\">2022.04.15</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-green-500 font-bold tracking-wider text-sm\" data-kid=\"83\">SENIOR_DATA_NODE</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-gray-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors leading-relaxed text-sm\" data-kid=\"84\">\n                                Optimized predictive demand kernels for the 'Invisible Supply Chain' protocol. Integrated PyTorch forecasting with 99.1% reliability under heavy load simulations.\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[160px_280px_1fr] p-6 hover:bg-cyan-500/5 transition-all group cursor-default\" data-kid=\"85\">\n                            <div class=\"text-cyan-500/60 text-sm\" data-kid=\"86\">2021.11.02</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-white font-bold tracking-wider text-sm\" data-kid=\"87\">SYSTEM_KERNEL_DEV</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-gray-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors leading-relaxed text-sm\" data-kid=\"88\">\n                                Engineered automated customs clearance smart-validators. Reduced documentation processing time from 48 hours to 12 seconds via sharded ledger verification.\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[160px_280px_1fr] p-6 bg-black/20 hover:bg-cyan-500/5 transition-all group cursor-default\" data-kid=\"89\">\n                            <div class=\"text-cyan-500/60 text-sm\" data-kid=\"90\">2020.01.20</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-white/40 font-bold tracking-wider text-sm\" data-kid=\"91\">LEGACY_MIGRATOR</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-gray-400 group-hover:text-white transition-colors leading-relaxed text-sm\" data-kid=\"92\">\n                                Decoupled monolith ERP kernels into distributed micro-nodes. Managed 4.2PB data migration without single point failure.\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"grid grid-c