ite\" data-kid=\"173\">MLFlow</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border-4 border-black p-8 brutalist-shadow bg-white\" data-kid=\"174\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl font-bebas mb-6 border-b-2 border-black pb-2\" data-kid=\"175\">LANGUAGES</h3>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"176\">\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-[#C85A17] text-white\" data-kid=\"177\">Python</span>\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-[#C85A17] text-white\" data-kid=\"178\">Rust</span>\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-[#C85A17] text-white\" data-kid=\"179\">SQL</span>\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-[#C85A17] text-white\" data-kid=\"180\">C++</span>\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-[#C85A17] text-white\" data-kid=\"181\">Go</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border-4 border-black p-8 brutalist-shadow bg-[#4A6A82]\" data-kid=\"182\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-4xl font-bebas mb-6 border-b-2 border-white text-white\" data-kid=\"183\">LOGISTICS_TECH</h3>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"184\">\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-white text-black\" data-kid=\"185\">GTN_Graphs</span>\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-white text-black\" data-kid=\"186\">AIS_Tracking</span>\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-white text-black\" data-kid=\"187\">Lidar_SLAM</span>\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-white text-black\" data-kid=\"188\">WMS_Oracle</span>\n                        <span class=\"stenciled-label bg-white text-black\" data-kid=\"189\">RFID_Eng</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"projects\" class=\"py-32 bg-[#F4F1EA] border-b-4 border-black\" data-kid=\"190\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8\" data-kid=\"191\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-bebas leading-[0.8] mb-24 border-l-12 border-black pl-8 uppercase\" data-kid=\"192\">Modular Units</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-16\" data-kid=\"193\">\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-[#C85A17] border-4 border-black p-8 brutalist-shadow hover:-translate-y-4 transition-transform relative group\" data-kid=\"194\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\" data-kid=\"195\">\n                        <div class=\"text-4xl font-bebas text-white\" data-kid=\"196\">UNIT_01: OMEGA</div>\n                        <span class=\"border-2 border-white text-white px-2 py-1 font-mono text-xs\" data-kid=\"197\">ID: SC-001</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-video border-4 border-black bg-black overflow-hidden mb-6\" data-kid=\"198\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591880364988-18d5284077db?auto=format&w=600&q=80&fit=crop\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-125 group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" alt=\"Project Omega\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"199\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-white font-medium text-lg leading-snug mb-8\" data-kid=\"200\">\n                        Autonomous terminal operating system using real-time edge computer vision for multi-modal container tracking.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"201\">\n                        <span class=\"bg-black text-white px-2 py-1 font-bebas\" data-kid=\"202\">VISION_AI</span>\n                        <span class=\"bg-black text-white px-2 py-1 font-bebas\" data-kid=\"203\">CUDA</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute -top-6 -right-6 w-16 h-16 bg-white border-4 border-black flex items-center justify-center rotate-12 brutalist-shadow-sm\" data-kid=\"204\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-box text-3xl\" data-kid=\"205\"></i>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-[#1E3F33] border-4 border-black p-8 brutalist-shadow hover:-translate-y-4 transition-transform lg:mt-16 group\" data-kid=\"206\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\" data-kid=\"207\">\n                        <div class=\"text-4xl font-bebas text-white\" data-kid=\"208\">UNIT_02: FLUX</div>\n                        <span class=\"border-2 border-white text-white px-2 py-1 font-mono text-xs\" data-kid=\"209\">ID: SC-002</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-video border-4 border-black bg-black overflow-hidden mb-6\" data-kid=\"210\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605732562084-f528a2154616?auto=format&w=600&q=80&fit=crop\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-125 group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" alt=\"Project Flux\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"211\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-white font-medium text-lg leading-snug mb-8\" data-kid=\"212\">\n                        Temporal Graph Neural Network for global routing optimization and predictive bottleneck mitigation.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"213\">\n                        <span class=\"bg-black text-white px-2 py-1 font-bebas\" data-kid=\"214\">GRAPH_NET</span>\n                        <span class=\"bg-black text-white px-2 py-1 font-bebas\" data-kid=\"215\">RUST</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-[#4A6A82] border-4 border-black p-8 brutalist-shadow hover:-translate-y-4 transition-transform relative group lg:mt-32\" data-kid=\"216\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-6\" data-kid=\"217\">\n                        <div class=\"text-4xl font-bebas text-white\" data-kid=\"218\">UNIT_03: VOID</div>\n                        <span class=\"border-2 border-white text-white px-2 py-1 font-mono text-xs\" data-kid=\"219\">ID: SC-003</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-video border-4 border-black bg-black overflow-hidden mb-6\" data-kid=\"220\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1634378990159-a1d4a5252905?auto=format&w=600&q=80&fit=crop\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-125 group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\" alt=\"Project Void\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"221\">\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"text-white font-medium text-lg leading-snug mb-8\" data-kid=\"222\">\n                        End-to-end simulation environment for testing autonomous logistics fleets in zero-trust industrial scenarios.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"223\">\n                        <span class=\"bg-black text-white px-2 py-1 font-bebas\" data-kid=\"224\">TWIN_SYS</span>\n                        <span class=\"bg-black text-white px-2 py-1 font-bebas\" data-kid=\"225\">UNITY</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"contact\" class=\"py-32 bg-[#F4F1EA] relative overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"226\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-8 relative z-10\" data-kid=\"227\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-24 items-center\" data-kid=\"228\">\n                \n                <div data-kid=\"229\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-bebas leading-[0.8] mb-12 uppercase\" data-kid=\"230\">Dispatch Center</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-8\" data-kid=\"231\">\n                        <div class=\"border-4 border-black p-8 bg-white brutalist-shadow relative max-w-sm\" data-kid=\"232\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute -top-4 -left-4 bg-black text-white px-2 py-1 font-bebas\" data-kid=\"233\">HQ_COORDINATES</div>\n                            <p class=\"text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"234\">40.7128° N<br data-kid=\"235\">74.0060° W</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-xs font-mono mt-2 opacity-50\" data-kid=\"236\">NEW YORK LOGISTICS NODE</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border-4 border-black p-8 bg-white brutalist-shadow relative max-w-sm\" data-kid=\"237\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute -top-4 -left-4 bg-black text-white px-2 py-1 font-bebas\" data-kid=\"238\">COMMS_CHANNEL</div>\n                            <p class=\"text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter\" data-kid=\"239\">DISPATCH@FOUND.AI</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-4\" data-kid=\"240\">\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-black hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all\" data-kid=\"241\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-brand-linkedin text-2xl\" data-kid=\"242\"></i>\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-black hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all\" data-kid=\"243\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-brand-github text-2xl\" data-kid=\"244\"></i>\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-black hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all\" data-kid=\"245\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-brand-x text-2xl\" data-kid=\"246\"></i>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                \n                <div class=\"relative pt-12\" data-kid=\"247\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white border-8 border-black p-12 lg:p-16 brutalist-shadow isometric-plane relative\" data-kid=\"248\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 bg-black text-white font-bebas px-6 py-2 text-2xl\" data-kid=\"249\">TRANSMISSION_FORM_V3</div>\n                        \n                        <form class=\"space-y-12\" data-kid=\"250\">\n                            <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"251\">\n                                <label class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase absolute -top-4 left-0\" data-kid=\"252\">Originator_Identity</label>\n                                <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"SENDER_ID\" class=\"w-full border-b-4 border-black py-4 bg-transparent outline-none focus:border-[#C85A17] transition-colors font-bold text-xl uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"253\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"254\">\n                                <label class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase absolute -top-4 left-0\" data-kid=\"255\">Frequency_Carrier</label>\n                                <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"NAME@DOMAIN.COM\" class=\"w-full border-b-4 border-black py-4 bg-transparent outline-none focus:border-[#C85A17] transition-colors font-bold text-xl uppercase tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"256\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"257\">\n                                <label class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase absolute -top-4 left-0\" data-kid=\"258\">Data_Payload</label>\n                                <textarea rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"TRANSMIT_MESSAGE_HERE...\" class=\"w-full border-b-4 border-black py-4 bg-transparent outline-none focus:border-[#C85A17] transition-colors font-bold text-xl uppercase tracking-widest resize-none\" data-kid=\"259\"></textarea>\n                            </div>\n                            \n                            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full bg-[#C85A17] text-white font-bebas text-5xl py-6 border-4 border-black brutalist-shadow hover:translate-x-2 hover:translate-y-2 hover:shadow-none transition-all cursor-pointer\" data-kid=\"260\">\n                                DISPATCH MESSAGE\n                            </button>\n                        </form>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    \n                    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-40 h-40 bg-[#1E3F33] border-4 border-black brutalist-shadow z-[-1] animate-pulse\" data-kid=\"261\">\n                        <div class=\"blueprint-grid w-full h-full opacity-30\" data-kid=\"262\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 blueprint-grid opacity-5 pointer-events-none\" data-kid=\"263\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    \n    <footer class=\"py-12 border-t-8 border-black bg-black text-white px-8\" data-kid=\"264\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8\" data-kid=\"265\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\" data-kid=\"266\">\n                <span class=\"text-5xl font-bebas tracking-tighter border-2 border-white px-4 py-1\" data-kid=\"267\">ARCH_LOG_01</span>\n                <p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight opacity-50 max-w-[150px]\" data-kid=\"268\">\n                    SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE PORTFOLIO<br data-kid=\"269\">\n                    ALL RIGHTS RESERVED // 2024<br data-kid=\"270\">\n                    ENCRYPTION: AES-256-BIT\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end\" data-kid=\"271\">\n                <div class=\"text-4xl font-bebas tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"272\">BLUEPRINT FOR THE FUTURE</div>\n                <div class=\"h-1 w-full bg-[#C85A17] mt-2\" data-kid=\"273\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    \n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" data-kid=\"274\">\n</div>\n",
