                   <div class=\"w-10 h-10 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-500\" data-kid=\"89\">02</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"90\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"91\">\n                            <span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#0D9488] shrink-0\" data-kid=\"92\"></span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"93\">Developed real-time warehouse simulators reducing picking errors by 18%.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"94\">\n                            <span class=\"mt-2 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#0D9488] shrink-0\" data-kid=\"95\"></span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"96\">Integrated IoT sensor networks across 12 European distribution hubs.</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        \n        <section id=\"publications\" class=\"space-y-12\" data-kid=\"97\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"98\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-[#E04F3E] font-bold\" data-kid=\"99\">03/PUBLICATIONS</span>\n                <div class=\"h-px grow bg-slate-800\" data-kid=\"100\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\" data-kid=\"101\">\n                <div class=\"glass p-8 border border-white/5 hover:border-[#E04F3E]/30 transition-all group\" data-kid=\"102\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 mb-2 block uppercase font-bold tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"103\">Journal of Logistics Tech (2023)</span>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 group-hover:text-[#E04F3E] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"104\">\"Neural Networks in Dynamic Cross-Docking Operations\"</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6\" data-kid=\"105\">Exploring the impact of reinforcement learning on real-time decision-making in high-velocity distribution centers.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0D9488] uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-[#0D9488]/30 pb-1\" data-kid=\"106\">Read Publication_</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"glass p-8 border border-white/5 hover:border-[#0D9488]/30 transition-all group\" data-kid=\"107\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 mb-2 block uppercase font-bold tracking-widest\" data-kid=\"108\">International Supply Chain Summit (2022)</span>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 group-hover:text-[#0D9488] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"109\">\"Decentralized Visibility: A Blockchain Framework for Global Trade\"</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-6\" data-kid=\"110\">A comparative study of distributed ledger technologies for end-to-end container tracking across multi-modal networks.</p>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#E04F3E] uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-[#E04F3E]/30 pb-1\" data-kid=\"111\">Read Publication_</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        \n        <section id=\"projects\" class=\"space-y-16\" data-kid=\"112\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\" data-kid=\"113\">\n                <div class=\"h-px grow bg-white/5\" data-kid=\"114\"></div>\n                <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-syne font-bold text-white text-center uppercase tracking-widest px-8 border-x border-white/10\" data-kid=\"115\">Project Repositories</h2>\n                <div class=\"h-px grow bg-white/5\" data-kid=\"116\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\" data-kid=\"117\">\n                \n                <div class=\"group relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden glass border border-white/5 data-module\" data-kid=\"118\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/2239677/pexels-photo-2239677.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Supply Chain AI\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"119\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0A0F14] via-transparent to-transparent\" data-kid=\"120\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-8 w-full\" data-kid=\"121\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#E04F3E] block mb-2\" data-kid=\"122\">// AI_LOGISTICS</span>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4\" data-kid=\"123\">Predix Fleet Engine</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-2 mb-6\" data-kid=\"124\">Autonomous routing platform for electric freight vehicles using real-time traffic telemetry.</p>\n                        <button class=\"w-full py-3 border border-white/10 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all\" data-kid=\"125\">Execute Module</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                \n                <div class=\"group relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden glass border border-white/5 data-module\" data-kid=\"126\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/2101137/pexels-photo-2101137.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800&q=80\" alt=\"Blockchain Tracking\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"127\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0A0F14] via-transparent to-transparent\" data-kid=\"128\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-8 w-full\" data-kid=\"129\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0D9488] block mb-2\" data-kid=\"130\">// LEDGER_NET</span>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4\" data-kid=\"131\">CargoChain v2</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-2 mb-6\" data-kid=\"132\">Ethereum-based Bill of Lading system for immutable tracking of ocean freight.</p>\n                        <button class=\"w-full py-3 border border-white/10 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all\" data-kid=\"133\">Execute Module</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                \n                <div class=\"group relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden glass border border-white/5 data-module\" data-kid=\"134\">\n                    <img src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/2582937/pexels-photo-2582937.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=800&q=80\" alt=\"IoT Control\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-kid=\"135\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0A0F14] via-transparent to-transparent\" data-kid=\"136\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 p-8 w-full\" data-kid=\"137\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500 block mb-2\" data-kid=\"138\">// SENSOR_NODE</span>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4\" data-kid=\"139\">Hydra IoT Hub</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 line-clamp-2 mb-6\" data-kid=\"140\">Industrial gateway connecting legacy PLCs to cloud-based predictive maintenance dashboards.</p>\n                        <button class=\"w-full py-3 border border-white/10 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all\" data-kid=\"141\">Execute Module</button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        \n        <section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12\" data-kid=\"142\">\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-1 space-y-6\" data-kid=\"143\">\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-[#E04F3E]\" data-kid=\"144\">03/STACK</span>\n                <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-syne font-bold text-white tracking-tight uppercase\" data-kid=\"145\">Core Technical Protocols</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"146\">\n                    My expertise spans the entire technology stack required for modern supply chain orchestration, from low-level sensor integration to high-level strategic analytics.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-2 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4\" data-kid=\"147\">\n                <div class=\"p-6 glass border border-white/5 text-center group hover:border-[#0D9488]/30 transition-all\" data-kid=\"148\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2\" data-kid=\"149\">95%</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-[#0D9488] tracking-widest font-bold\" data-kid=\"150\">Logistics ERP</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 glass border border-white/5 text-center group hover:border-[#0D9488]/30 transition-all\" data-kid=\"151\">\n                    <div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2\" data-kid=\"152\">88%</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-[#0D9488] tracking-widest font-bold\" data-kid=\"153\">Digital Twins</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 glass border border-white/5 text-c